# Force LF endings for files that run inside Linux containers or are
# parsed by tools that care (shell scripts, Dockerfiles, YAML). Without
# this, Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true would convert these to
# CRLF, breaking shebangs (`$'\r': command not found`) once copied into a
# Linux-based Docker image.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
